// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  VGN TEXT-GAME TEMPLATE — data file (main.pjs)
//  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  This generator is a reusable template for TEXT-BASED games that
//  run inside a CRT-arcade-cabinet shell (the engine + cabinet live
//  in index.html; you should rarely need to touch it).
//
//  HOW TO MAKE YOUR OWN GAME:
//    1. Duplicate this generator (or copy main.pjs + index.html
//       into a new generator).
//    2. Edit `cfg` below: title, subtitle, intro, starting
//       stats, stat icons, and the automatic lose-rules in endWhen.
//    3. Rewrite the `story` list — that is your whole game.
//    4. Add random flavor events to `events` (optional).
//    5. Replace cfg.image + $meta.image with your own art.
//
//  ── STORY SYNTAX (see the demo below for working examples) ──
//
//    story
//      nodeKey
//        title = Heading shown above the text
//        text                → paragraphs, one per line (blank line between)
//        repeatText          → shown INSTEAD of `text` when this node is
//                              visited a second time
//        effects             → stat changes applied when you ARRIVE here:
//          food = -10        →   values ALWAYS ADD to the stat, so a
//          gold = 5          →   negative number subtracts, positive adds
//        choices
//          anyName
//            label  = Button text shown to the player
//            to     = key of the next node
//            if     = condition (optional) — hides the choice unless true,
//                     e.g. `stats.gold >= 20`, `!visited.cave`, `stats.hp < 50`
//            effects= stat changes applied when you CHOOSE this
//        ending = win | lose  → reaching this node ends the game
//
//  ── DYNAMIC TEXT ──
//  Put <<expression>> in any text line to inject a live value, e.g.
//  "You have <<stats.food>> lbs of food." Inside << >> and inside
//  every `if`, these are available: `stats` (the stat object),
//  `name`, `S` (whole game state), `visited`. Plain JS is allowed:
//  <<Math.floor(stats.food / 2)>>.
//
//  ── RANDOM EVENTS ──
//  After each choice there is a cfg.eventChance chance that a
//  random `events` entry appears (weighted by `weight`, default 1).
//
//  ── AUTO-LOSS RULES ──
//  cfg.endWhen lets you end the game when a condition fires
//  (checked after every stat change), e.g. health reaching 0.
//
//  The demo below is a small playable western journey that shows off
//  every feature. Replace it with your own game.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

$meta
  title = VGN Text Game Template
  description = A reusable template for text-based games inside a CRT arcade cabinet. Write your story, stats and events in main.pjs; the engine and cabinet are in index.html.
  image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/b6ccac2977b8cbb39dadf1a31db97d1a.jpg
  tags = template, text game, adventure, interactive fiction, crt, arcade
  header
    mode = minimal

kv = {import:kv-plugin}

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  GAME CONFIG — rename, retitle, restat to fit your game
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

cfg
  title = The Long Road
  subtitle = A small western journey — replace this with your own story.
  image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/b6ccac2977b8cbb39dadf1a31db97d1a.jpg
  intro = You have outfitted a wagon and gathered your party. The year is 1848, the place is Independence, Missouri, and Oregon City lies two thousand miles west. Every choice on the trail is a gamble of food, coin and health.
  playerName = Wagon Master
  eventChance = 0.35
  typeSpeed = 5
  winText = WELCOME TO OREGON! The long road is behind you.
  loseText = The trail claims you. Your story ends here.
  musicUrl = https://user.uploads.dev/file/c7285d4190c50ae8928c936bf0ab66d7.mp3
  startingStats
    hp = 100
    food = 120
    gold = 80
  statIcons
    hp = ❤️
    food = 🥖
    gold = 🪙
  endWhen
    noHealth
      condition = stats.hp < 1
      result = lose
      message = Your party gives out — no strength left to go on.

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  RANDOM EVENTS — flavor/encounters that pop up between choices
//  (each entry: optional title, text lines, optional effects,
//   optional weight)
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

events
  trader
    title = A Passing Trader
    text
      A trader rides up alongside the wagon and shares a few pounds of dried meat before riding on.
    effects
      food = 10
    weight = 2
  storm
    title = Night Storm
    text
      A hard rain hammers the wagon all night. By dawn you are soaked, and some supplies are ruined.
    effects
      food = -8
      hp = -5
    weight = 2
  grave
    title = A Lonely Grave
    text
      You pass a fresh grave beside the trail, a crude board bearing a name worn smooth by weather. The trail keeps its accounts.
  shortcut
    title = A Shortcut
    text
      A well-worn cutoff shaves miles off the trail.
    effects
      food = -3

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  THE STORY — replace the demo nodes below with your own game.
//  Every node: title + text (+ optional repeatText, effects,
//  choices, ending). Choices: label + to (+ optional if, effects).
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

story
  start
    title = The Trailhead
    text
      <<name>>, you stand at the trailhead outside Independence, Missouri. The wagon groans under its load, and the oxen shift restlessly.
      You carry <<stats.food>> lbs of food and <<stats.gold>> coins. Two thousand miles of raw country lie between you and Oregon City.
    choices
      river
        label = Follow the river west
        to = river
        effects
          food = -5
      plains
        label = Cut across the high plains
        to = plains
        effects
          food = -10
      guide
        label = Hire a guide ($20)
        to = guide
        if = stats.gold >= 20
        effects
          gold = -20
          food = -3
  river
    title = The Kansas River
    text
      The Kansas River spreads wide and brown before you. A ferryman poling a flat scow calls out: "Eight dollars to carry the wagon across!"
      The ford downstream is free, but the current looks wicked.
    choices
      ferry
        label = Take the ferry ($8)
        to = camp
        if = stats.gold >= 8
        effects
          gold = -8
          food = -3
      ford
        label = Ford the river yourself
        to = fordSplash
        effects
          food = -15
  fordSplash
    title = A Soaking
    text
      The wagon slips off a sandbar midstream and the current drags it sideways. You heave it ashore by main strength, soaked to the bone, and a good share of the food is ruined.
      The trail presses on.
    choices
      continue
        label = Dry out and push on
        to = camp
  plains
    title = The High Plains
    text
      The plains stretch to the horizon, empty and immense. Grasshoppers click in the dry grass. It is fast going, but the wagon rattles hard over the alkali flats.
    choices
      continue
        label = Keep the pace
        to = camp
        effects
          food = -12
  guide
    title = The Guide
    text
      A grizzled mountain man, face like saddle leather, signs on for a day's ride ahead of you. He knows every dry creek and Indian crossing on this stretch, and the miles melt away.
      You reach the evening camp early, save for a few rations.
    choices
      continue
        label = Reach camp
        to = camp
  camp
    title = Evening Camp
    text
      Firelight. The oxen low softly, and the stars come out like spilled salt. You sit by the coals and think about the miles yet to come.
    repeatText
      The camp looks much as it did before. The fire is banked, the coffee pot is on, and the road still stretches ahead.
    choices
      hunt
        label = Hunt for game before dark
        to = huntResult
        effects
          food = 30
      trade
        label = Trade with a passing family
        to = tradeResult
        effects
          gold = -10
      push
        label = Break camp and move on
        to = mountains
        effects
          food = -5
  huntResult
    title = The Hunt
    text
      You walk out with the rifle and come back over your shoulder with a fat buck. Good meat on the table tonight.
    choices
      move
        label = Break camp at first light
        to = mountains
  tradeResult
    title = The Trade
    text
      A family in a smaller wagon wants to lighten their load. You swap coin for a sack of flour and a bundle of dried apples.
    choices
      move
        label = Break camp at first light
        to = mountains
  mountains
    title = The Blue Mountains
    text
      The trail climbs into pine-dark mountains. The air thins, the nights turn cold, and the wagon strains axle-deep through the passes. You have <<Math.round(stats.food)>> lbs of food left, and Oregon is still over the horizon.
    choices
      push
        label = Press through the passes
        to = oregonCity
        effects
          food = -25
          hp = -15
      rest
        label = Rest a day and hunt
        to = mountainCamp
        effects
          hp = 12
  mountainCamp
    title = A Cold Camp
    text
      You spend a day drying gear, mending the harness and hunting. By the time you move again you feel like yourselves once more.
    choices
      push
        label = Press through the passes
        to = oregonCity
        effects
          food = -20
          hp = -8
  oregonCity
    title = Oregon City
    text
      The Columbia River roars below you and then, at last, the wooden streets of Oregon City open ahead — mills turning, sawdust in the air, a whole new country waiting.
      You have crossed the continent.
    ending = win
